1
00:00:00,600 --> 00:00:03,381
Your best employee is copy-pasting.

2
00:00:03,500 --> 00:00:05,340
Sixty-four good leads went cold.

3
00:00:05,400 --> 00:00:07,924
Nobody had time to touch them.

4
00:00:08,600 --> 00:00:10,540
So the workflow does.

5
00:00:11,900 --> 00:00:14,795
It enriches each lead from the web.

6
00:00:15,100 --> 00:00:18,240
Then scores the fit against your best customers.

7
00:00:18,300 --> 00:00:21,440
Writes a first touch that names their problem.

8
00:00:21,500 --> 00:00:24,394
Sends it, then watches for a reply.

9
00:00:24,700 --> 00:00:27,092
When a reply lands, it sorts it.

10
00:00:27,700 --> 00:00:30,409
Sixty-four dead leads revived.

11
00:00:30,900 --> 00:00:33,614
All of it in your CRM by lunch.

12
00:00:33,900 --> 00:00:36,057
Two to three weeks to build.

13
00:00:36,800 --> 00:00:38,600
Book a fit call.

14
00:00:40,000 --> 00:00:42,713
inodepi.github.io
